-Good night.

73
00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:48.833
<i>I'm yours, you are mine, mine</i>

74
00:07:49.416 --> 00:07:52.750
<i>I am yours, you are my beautiful queen</i>

75
00:07:52.833 --> 00:07:55.458
<i>My soul is yours, my heart is yours</i>

76
00:07:55.541 --> 00:07:57.916
<i>You are my fate, darling</i>

77
00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.375
<i>You are my mad girl</i>

78
00:08:00.458 --> 00:08:02.583
<i>Just how to love you</i>

79
00:08:12.833 --> 00:08:14.541
<i>Darling</i>

80
00:08:14.625 --> 00:08:15.958
<i>It hits me on my heart</i>

81
00:08:25.208 --> 00:08:26.541
I didn't think you'd come.

82
00:08:26.625 --> 00:08:28.083
I didn't want to,

83
