<i>Darling</i>

113
00:10:09.875 --> 00:10:12.458
<i>You got my heart</i>

114
00:10:12.541 --> 00:10:14.708
<i>Your grace</i>

115
00:10:14.791 --> 00:10:17.791
<i>Darling, you don't know</i>

116
00:10:17.875 --> 00:10:21.083
<i>Darling, it is addicting</i>

117
00:10:21.166 --> 00:10:22.541
<i>Darling</i>

118
