we danced till we dropped.

127
00:10:54.666 --> 00:10:56.750
We used to just go on and on and on.

128
00:10:57.708 --> 00:10:58.750
It was fun.

129
00:10:59.333 --> 00:11:01.208
You know, to dance

130
00:11:01.291 --> 00:11:05.458
you need people
with whom you don't need to pretend.

131
