138
00:11:48.333 --> 00:11:51.208
-Nothing. I got hurt in my childhood.
-How?

139
00:11:52.500 --> 00:11:54.833
Forget it. I don't remember how.

140
00:11:56.833 --> 00:11:59.750
Will you remember this night
or will you forget this, too?

141
